  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《一个人ê下晡》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳俐雯</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhCUk1dOId10OG0iRhOkcciViHKCbPL7RsuZW1fuBbV-5ITI4NgqmJJMHdAygvZVMY4pg0nQQJRcq6NTKjTe67XOZPMAIkU3kDe6Y8MFZpgCD0zo1vhNEhUHn-pdTqNprY8zwaQPbmn0DxsvTsyh8pRGSJp2KiWSkuNsUnclhW2SGYS8a2x_l4mgQOZlURk\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhCUk1dOId10OG0iRhOkcciViHKCbPL7RsuZW1fuBbV-5ITI4NgqmJJMHdAygvZVMY4pg0nQQJRcq6NTKjTe67XOZPMAIkU3kDe6Y8MFZpgCD0zo1vhNEhUHn-pdTqNprY8zwaQPbmn0DxsvTsyh8pRGSJp2KiWSkuNsUnclhW2SGYS8a2x_l4mgQOZlURk=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">烏雲lio̍h-lio̍h仔挲過日頭</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Chhàng鬚ê燒氣沓沓仔lian--去</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">神--去ê頭殼用鬥搭ê節奏，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">飛chiūⁿ烏phú ê雲尪</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我ê翁某囝兒、親人朋友、錢財名利……</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Chia一切ê「有」，kám真正是我ê？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">徛踮雙叉路口</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">繁華鬧熱ê路--裡</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">車來來去去</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">In是beh去佗位？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Chia規路chheⁿ-cho̍h閃身ê聲</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Kám是teh講人有夢上súi？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">原來地動--ê是我ê心</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tòng-gōng ê頭殼tī時間ê chhoah流</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">勻勻仔坐清</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">了解無常吞食美麗是無情ê事實</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">明白性命在穩ê「有」是絕對ê「無」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">人生在世無一項mi̍h件是我ê</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Chit chōa旅程</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">唯一ē-tàng掌握--ê</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>kan-na是活--leh ê分分秒秒</span></span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57q